OL,3,GNEWSAWanted pub rapist caught after
OL,4,Arunning red light
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who raped a 17-year-old girl in a
OL,7,Fpub toilet in Leicester before going on
OL,8,Fthe run for two months was arrested
OL,9,Fafter driving through a red traffic
OL,10,Flight, police have said.
OL,12,FPolice said Pandeli Dervishi, 24,
OL,13,Fforced the girl to perform oral sex on
OL,14,Fhim inside the toilets of a pub in The
OL,15,FNewarke on 1 October 2025.
OL,17,FOfficers were called after the victim
OL,18,Fwas heard in distress by a member of
OL,19,Fthe public, and Dervishi was arrested
OL,20,Fbefore being charged with rape in
OL,21,FFebruary.
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
