OL,3,GNEWSAWanted pub rapist caught after
OL,4,Arunning red light
OL,5,
OL,6,FAfter failing to answer bail, Dervishi
OL,7,Fwas eventually arrested when a police
OL,8,Fofficer spotted him running a red light
OL,9,Fin Surrey on 16 April. Following a
OL,10,Ftrial, Dervishi was jailed for seven
OL,11,Fyears and six months on Thursday.
